SIyTPLuRYOsnicp0qxZ0ObUrZnaiah9mAwHyTt7BYic8ue883Poouibls9AOtub2iamviaprIYL0sCHyRRcuj8cYpGfE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX6Tu9bLtdDmKEWDDdzOzicjAohYnUTW5UWsvIYqT9D9SSETFhl2DGwrOcdN5VLZJP1Fnb6N22ZCcNdQTz7Jj0sZibfI5wraAHa38/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX42KpE4X9pvLdBZNwF0aVFy4aJr0Zd2bricR75bKtWybzss3POd9yuPSBcMtSvfuI6gj7c1FDicO3ZbX4Uricg8b5rDsehL2dhx8s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX5woACaFUboxibW9JYnFAJJKbSq9b6uFWqwVWMrnia0Mx8GObKRN7vK7JoQ53YjZ0HDS4q552hhiaQeSSh7NsumzDhlz0rrJhaHicc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX4z2VBCcke4o9prA6A9khBBAZgUh5SuAjleq98JSPF5icKic5AecOicySHO21HhBdiaroTS1J70ehRPQtGPIpUQeKXzrl3VxJZxA8w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国科学院上海光机所2026年“追光之旅”暑期大学生夏令营拟于2026年7月初举办，预计分两期，</span><strong><span>第一期7月6日-7月8日</span></strong><span>举办，</span><strong><span>第二期7月13日-7月15日</span></strong><span>举办，具体视报名情况确定。夏令营期间将安排参观本所、聆听专家报告、听取各科研单元介绍、近距离接触尖端设备、与师兄师姐和导师交流等活动。</span></p><p><span>每期夏令营将面向全国双一流高校优秀本科生接收</span><strong><span>150</span></strong><span>名左右营员。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/uJvO9NPwQX6vv06HvZLZLCqSAEGdBFOlEZyXY4FU6dClTVXvPmicY1ibLgeruHwDHbVmVQiaWwVFCFDFPcrmxfA8MdYBtVfNPJp1nmtVvFV3y8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX4HPiaAo9RFkSmsLic8btZ5cv1sRs6jWiarLS3y6qR3QnZsje8UQ0L7ppAgMIy7FfJnyQu1gibXtRGWyRWcrxtHsD9SyBAoCabokFo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、物理、光电、材料、机械、电子、通信、测控、仪器、自动化等相关专业的三年级学生（2027年7月毕业）。</span></p><p><span>2、成绩优秀，预估可获得本校推免资格。</span></p><p><span>3、对我所从事专业有浓厚兴趣，具有较强或潜在的研究能力，有意来我所求学深造。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX65E9IVOmUvghEKib7V1s0bkuZn0w1iauq9YPqAwGT8jbicnsOMo8FcEqv23ZicWM5Ev0VlZEANQAjkYILHRTDia7531Klib1op7qkjY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二、申请办法及时间</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、申请办法：</span></strong><span>点击链接（https://v.wjx.cn/vm/YdIJEHF.aspx#）或扫描下方二维码填写填写个人信息并提交。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/uJvO9NPwQX54A0qKEzHFuaTiapFWYlgZEzFebc1fNc9xsnaShgLrJ1BlLVomzXiaLQGiaxZsVTOngtMXCmvqPWQnxtLk5O9097RRFNBoAX5098/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>2、报名时间：</span></strong><span>即日起—2026年6月20日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年6月底前，我所将确定入围名单并通过电子邮件直接通知本人。届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX6ZMFibegCzza3cfLWk7MmAMBTltj7CBQPA1gk4qSybELTGICxyuROljLfFIkYfxib7jTTQyHwCahucxW7wR5GvHlbqMdwZwWsqI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三、申请材料</span><span><span>（提交方式待入选后通知）</span></span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、《中国科学院上海光机所2026年“追光之旅”暑期大学生夏令营申请表》（点击阅读原文下载）。</span></p><p><span>2、本科成绩单和专业排名证明（需加盖教务处或院系公章）。</span></p><p><span>3、其他证明材料（如已发表论文复印件、奖状复印件、英语四、六级成绩单、各类证书等）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX7TcRghI766j13iaCSibQRnY6vnh8HUKD6ic1wSTWLfjicibR3UnoDNGCWyfChGpZS8jbh2jH5uX4pYT0R64yWKzibciaqgmP1CRQzYp0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四、其他事项</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、参加夏令营活动的同学应遵守我所夏令营的各项规定，按照统一安排参加各项营内活动。</span></p><p><span>2、夏令营举办形式和日程待后续通知，若线下举办，我所将提供营员夏令营期间的在沪食宿。</span></p><p><span>3、夏令营活动期间学生安全由本人负责，若线下举办，我所将为营员购买意外险。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/uJvO9NPwQX4IKIyDnwXHXr99BOorXKbEWIQZ1ueaYiaiaOuR0WYZex33ousicf8BOBdbSn83M5LmrAKCcY3ZQTkAtYzDu4BEsZTZzVNK4RZH1A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\